# Generated single-file preview bundles.
#
# The site is six separate HTML files; the bundle inlines all of them plus the
# CSS and JS into one document for previewing. It is build output, it goes
# stale against the real pages the moment either changes, and GitHub Pages
# would exclude a leading-underscore file from the published site anyway.
_preview*.html

